Aug 16 22:21:04 silt-ft-val-a-6fbcf2e-18553 silt[998]: consensus: operator-margin defaulted to 2 for this untrusted (objective) swarm — the C2 maturity shed discounts the bond-distinct Nakamoto coefficient by M, so one operator splitting real stake across ~M NodeIDs cannot fake the decentralization that sheds the launch anchors. Override with -operator-margin (1 = no split margin; safe only for a trusted/single-operator swarm).
